                "text": "If being a \"chaos agent\" means we're fighting back against slashes to funding for Veterans' benefits, Medicaid, Social Security, affordable housing, and more, then so be it.\n\nIn case anyone forgot: Republicans control the House, Senate, and the White House\u2014if they can't pass their own bills and keep the government open themselves, then I think they have a little chaos of their own.",
