                "text": "Social Security and Medicaid are lifelines for seniors, children, and countless others \u2014 but Trump and Republicans in Congress are waging an all-out assault on both.\n\nLet\u2019s talk about it. \u2935\ufe0f https://t.co/b4OYcOwazH",
