                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thank you Sec. Becerra for coming to Santa Barbara today for a critical conversation with Cencal Health, Planned Parenthood Central Coast, and Access Central Coast about the GOP\u2019s cruel plan to slash Medicaid & other health benefits.\n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting to protect the health care thousands on the Central Coast rely on. Health care should be a right \u2014 not a privilege.",
