                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Senate Republicans just voted for Trump\u2019s \u201cOne Big, Beautiful Bill\u201d\u2014but here\u2019s the truth:\n\n\u274c Largest cut to Medicaid in years\n\u274c Rips food away from kids, veterans, & seniors\n\u274c Adds $4 TRILLION to our national debt\n\nThis bill is cruel, reckless, and wrong. We won\u2019t stop fighting back.",
