                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 Families on the Central Coast: I want to hear from you!\n\nAs health care costs soar and premium tax credits are at risk of expiring, your story matters. How will these major price-jumps in insurance impact your household? \n\nShare your experience now: https://t.co/Dt7cyLyspE",
